  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing COMESA&apos;s M&amp;E Capacity to Monitor MTSP Implementation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the grant is to build COMESA&apos;s capacity in M&amp;E to help in the development of a results-focused Medium-Term Strategic Plan (MTSP) for the period 2011-2015, and to strengthen the alignment of national M&amp;E systems with the MTSP M&amp;E system for key regional priorities and outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
